		{
			dependencies: ["4495545F21463756"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>把它放在一个失业村民旁边，你就能得到一个 </grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>武器匠</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>他们交易枪支零件、弹药和火药。从村民那里买火药比种植苦力怕要平静得多。</grad></shadow>"
			]
