				"## <grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>运作方式</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将 </grad><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>乐谱</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>放入奥卡里纳。每张乐谱对应一个效果。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在奥卡里纳菜单的左侧选择一首</grad><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>歌谣</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。歌谣会改变乐谱的行为方式。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>完整体验所有内容。效果在游戏结束后生效，而非游戏过程中。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>无法制作床单。每一张都是通过探索、掠夺或掉落获得的，所以本章充满了各种结构名称。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Where the structures are\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#B98A5E\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"55CF3612F2588EA7\" } }"
			]
