		{
			dependencies: ["44C099D2D5AE4A16"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>面包和黄油片。每种各一张加上奥卡里纳，就已经物超所值了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>力量</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>：30秒内获得力量 II。下界堡垒的箱子里偶尔会掉落。"
