			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>好运</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 使幸运等级提升 II，持续 60 秒，且兔子极罕见地掉落该物品。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>幸运度会影响 </grad><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>Lucky Dice、</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> </grad><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>Die of Revival、</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> </grad><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>Devil's Dice、</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> </grad><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>Nullifying Dice 的上限。如果你走的是幸运流，这张表就是它们的天花板了。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>Prosperity</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 是另一个：成为村庄英雄 60 秒，在掠夺者前哨基地中较为常见。</grad></shadow>"
