		{
			dependencies: ["44C099D2D5AE4A16"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>并非每张卷轴都能增强玩家。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>虚弱化</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>：附近的生物在30秒内会变得</grad><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>易受伤害</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，所受所有伤害固定增加1.33倍。沙漠金字塔。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>虚弱</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>：持续30秒的虚弱 II。极罕见地来自僵尸和骷髅。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>漂浮术</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 附近所有生物获得5秒漂浮效果。潜行兽除外。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>毁灭</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>：对附近的一切造成瞬间伤害 II。通过将 </grad><grad from=#7ED6C0 to=#CFF5EC f=0.8>生命乐谱</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>投入斯蒂吉亚血液制成。</grad></shadow>"
